---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Contact | Aadit Agrawal"
	description="How to contact Aadit Agrawal about engineering roles, applied AI work, research, and technical collaborations."
>
	<article class="text-page">
		<header class="text-page__intro">
			<p class="text-page__eyebrow font-mono">contact</p>
			<h1>Say hello.</h1>
			<p class="text-page__lede">
				Email is the best way to reach me. I read messages sent to
				<a href="mailto:mail@aaditagrawal.com">mail@aaditagrawal.com</a>.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section aria-labelledby="useful-message">
			<h2 id="useful-message">What makes a useful message</h2>
			<p>
				Tell me what you are building, the problem you want help with, and what you
				would like me to do. For a role, include the team, location or remote policy,
				timeline, and a link to the job description. For a technical collaboration,
				include the current state of the work and the decision you are trying to make.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="good-reasons">
			<h2 id="good-reasons">Good reasons to write</h2>
			<p>
				I am open to selective internships, new-grad roles, applied research work,
				developer-tool projects, and conversations about AI infrastructure, HPC,
				platform engineering, or useful software. I also welcome clear bug reports
				about public projects listed on this site.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section aria-labelledby="security">
			<h2 id="security">Security reports</h2>
			<p>
				For a security issue involving this site or one of my projects, use the subject
				line "security report" and identify the affected URL or repository. Do not send
				credentials, private user data, or destructive proof-of-concept material in the
				first message. I will reply with a safer way to exchange anything sensitive.
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.text-page {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-2xl);
		max-width: 58ch;
	}

	.text-page__intro {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-md);
		padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.text-page__eyebrow {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
	}

	.text-page h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
		line-height: 1.05;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}

	.text-page__lede {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.text-page section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-sm);
	}

	.text-page h2 {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.text-page section p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}
</style>
